shadcn/ui components in this directory
======================================

Most primitive components in this directory are derived from shadcn/ui and are
kept in sync with upstream on purpose (aside from the occasional short
descriptive comment), so that `shadcn diff` upgrades apply without merge
conflicts. For that reason they carry no per-file license header — this
folder-level notice covers them instead.

  Upstream:  shadcn/ui
  License:   MIT
  Copyright: Copyright (c) 2023 shadcn
  Verified:  https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/main/LICENSE.md

The full MIT permission notice is reproduced in the repository-root NOTICE file,
which is the canonical third-party provenance record for the project.

Not derived from shadcn/ui (original Plumix components that happen to live here):

  - sortable.tsx      — built on @dnd-kit
  - color-picker.tsx  — built on react-colorful

These are original works and are not covered by the shadcn/ui attribution above.
